      "message": "Android already implements a mechanism to reclaim background processes using process_madvise(): https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:frameworks/base/services/core/jni/com_android_server_am_CachedAppOptimizer.cpp. Why is that not enough?",
